    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Familiar Friend Feat)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Healing Beacon.</strong> Positive energy fills a 5-foot Emanation originating from your familiar while it is within 120 feet of you. Whenever an ally in that Emanation rolls a die to determine the Hit Points restored to a creature, the ally can treat a roll of 1 or 2 on the die as a 3.</p>",
